            </note>
            <note corresp="#d9-f2" n="1" xml:id="d9-f2-content">
                <p>Rusk’s discussion with Thanat concerned Chinese representation at the United
                    Nations and Laos. (Memoranda of conversation, September 18, 12:30 p.m.; ibid.,
                    Secretary’s Memoranda of Conversation: Lot 65 D 330)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d9-f3" n="2" xml:id="d9-f3-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed.</p>
            </note>
